silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'StorageNotIdentityConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the storage-leg morphism from the Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a (the Tartu vet-record payload) to the Mittens apex; also, the specific Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a storing the Tartu vet-record payload for Mittens, dated 2026-05-18, with hash sha256:7f4a...bf2c; also, the full Hom-profile of Mittens: type arrow (to Cat), domestic-cat refinement, taxonomy-source (to Felis catus/TSN 183798), evidence arrows (from vet records), quality arrows (body mass 4.3 kg), process arrows (vet exam), role arrows (clinic patient), storage arrow, validation arrows." .
